ChorusDraft Elixir experiment — unreleased
Modification notice — September 5, 2026

This branch contains a separate Linux Elixir reimplementation of the BlueBot and
Mastobot behavior derived from ChorusDraft 0.51.1. It is developed separately on
the elixir-experimental branch and is not part of the supported Ruby release.
The implementation includes Jetstream, state import, and Linux packaging;
live account acceptance remains outstanding. No Elixir release has been published.

ChorusDraft is based on the feature sets of Bluesky Bot 1.0.3 and Mastodon Bot
1.0.2, authored by Buntatoes and distributed under the GNU General Public License
version 3. The Elixir experiment remains under GPLv3. See LICENSE for the complete
terms and elixir/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for dependency notices.

